{"seq":55,"slug":"stream-processing-realtime","title":"流处理与实时计算","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"流处理与实时计算\">流处理与实时计算</h1><p>数据不再是夜里跑一次批处理任务就能消化的静态资产。订单、点击、传感器读数、日志、支付事件——它们以连续不断的流的形式涌入系统，而业务方要的答案是「现在」，不是「明天早上」。流处理就是为这种「永不结束的数据」而生的计算范式：把计算搬到数据流动的路径上，让结果随事件到达而持续更新。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 用四章把流处理从思想讲到落地。第一章「基础」回答最根本的问题：流和批到底差在哪、为什么不能用批的思路硬套流。我们会拆开无界数据集的本质，看 Lambda 与 Kappa 两种架构如何在「正确」与「简单」之间权衡，并把整个领域最反直觉的概念——时间语义与水位线——讲透。事件发生的时间和系统处理它的时间几乎从不一致，承认并驾驭这种错位，是流处理的第一道门槛。</p>\n<p>第二章「流式算子」转向「怎么表达计算」。无状态转换是流水线的基本积木；窗口把无界的流切成可计算的有限片段，让聚合重新变得有意义；连接与聚合则让多条流交汇、让指标随时间滚动。这一章告诉你，流上的算子和批上的算子形似而神异——同样叫 join，在流上要面对时间、状态和无限增长的挑战。</p>\n<p>第三章「状态与容错」是流处理工业级落地的核心，也是它最硬的技术内核。有状态的计算才有价值，但状态一旦崩溃就要能精确恢复。我们顺着「状态如何存」→「检查点如何拍快照」→「如何做到恰好一次」三步，讲清楚现代流引擎凭什么敢承诺「故障后结果不多不少」。这三篇环环相扣：状态是被保护的对象，检查点是保护的机制，恰好一次是机制兑现的承诺。</p>\n<p>第四章「引擎与实践」收口于真实世界。我们横向对比 Flink、Kafka Streams、Spark Structured Streaming 三大引擎的设计取舍，看流式 SQL 如何把前三章的概念压缩成几行声明式查询，最后落到扩展与运维——背压、重缩放、状态迁移这些真正决定系统能否长期跑下去的工程细节。</p>\n<p>四章层层递进：基础奠定世界观，算子提供表达力，状态与容错保证正确性，引擎与实践让一切可运行。读完你应当能独立判断一个实时需求该用什么架构、什么语义、什么引擎，以及它会在哪里出问题。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stream-vs-batch","title":"流处理与批处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/foundations/stream-vs-batch"},{"seq":2,"slug":"streaming-architecture","title":"流式架构：Lambda 与 Kappa","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/foundations/streaming-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"time-semantics","title":"时间语义与水位线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/foundations/time-semantics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"operators","title":"流式算子","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/operators","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stateless-transformations","title":"无状态转换算子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/operators/stateless-transformations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"windowing","title":"窗口：滚动、滑动与会话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/operators/windowing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"joins-aggregations","title":"流式连接与聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/operators/joins-aggregations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-fault","title":"状态与容错","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/state-fault","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-management","title":"状态管理与状态后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/state-fault/state-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"checkpointing-recovery","title":"检查点与故障恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/state-fault/checkpointing-recovery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exactly-once-processing","title":"恰好一次处理语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/state-fault/exactly-once-processing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engines","title":"引擎与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stream-engines","title":"流处理引擎：Flink、Kafka Streams、Spark","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/engines/stream-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-sql","title":"流式 SQL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/engines/stream-sql"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scaling-operations","title":"扩展与运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/engines/scaling-operations"}]}]}